OL,3,AHow backlash against data centres could
OL,4,Ashape the US midterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FA year ago, a longtime US senator was
OL,7,Fnot thinking much about data centres.
OL,8,Fb@Kb@K
OL,10,FNow, according to one of his advisers,
OL,11,Fhe is having regular meetings with
OL,12,Fstaff to track their impact and working
OL,13,Fon new legislation aimed at curbing
OL,14,Ftheir rapid expansion across the
OL,15,Fcountry.
OL,17,F"This happens sometimes, something
OL,18,Fstarts slow and then it goes fast," the
OL,19,Fsenior policy adviser to the Democratic
OL,20,Fsenator told the BBC. The person spoke
OL,21,Fon condition of anonymity as they are
OL,22,Fnot permitted to speak to the press.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
