OL,3,AHow backlash against data centres could
OL,4,Ashape the US midterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 180-degree turn in this senator's
OL,7,Fattention was driven almost entirely by
OL,8,Fa growing wave of public backlash that
OL,9,Fhas seen politicians across the country
OL,10,Fscramble to keep up. Public sentiment
OL,11,Fhas turned against the expansion of
OL,12,Fdata centres, the large warehouses that
OL,13,Fstore processing power needed for
OL,14,Finternet activity.
